### 1. Get Room Utilisation Summary (Table Data)
# Returns a list of all rooms with their occupancy and capacity stats
GET http://localhost:8080/api/analytics/rooms/summary
Accept: application/json


### 2. Get Building Stats
# Returns utilization percentages grouped by building
GET http://localhost:8080/api/analytics/buildings
Accept: application/json


### 3. Get Peak Usage for a Specific Room
# Replace 'library-level2-quiet' with a valid ID from your database
GET http://localhost:8080/api/analytics/rooms/library-level2-quiet/peak
Accept: application/json


### 4. Get Most Used Rooms (Insights)
# Returns rooms with the highest occupancy rates
GET http://localhost:8080/api/analytics/rooms/most-used
Accept: application/json


### 5. Get Least Used Rooms (Insights)
# Returns rooms with the lowest occupancy rates
GET http://localhost:8080/api/analytics/rooms/least-used
Accept: application/json


### 6. Get Under-Utilised Rooms (Insights)
# Returns rooms specifically flagged as being below efficient capacity
GET http://localhost:8080/api/analytics/rooms/under-utilised
Accept: application/json